WEBVTT

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:33.345
Fortune teller

00:00:33.345 --> 00:00:34.159
Wake up

00:00:34.159 --> 00:00:35.561
Don't you wanna do business?

00:00:35.561 --> 00:00:36.765
Help me to take a look

00:00:36.765 --> 00:00:38.939
How's the KPI achievement for this year?

00:00:39.709 --> 00:00:43.662
You have dark brow ridges and slit mouth

00:00:43.662 --> 00:00:45.442
Even if you cake your face

00:00:45.442 --> 00:00:47.239
You still can't cover up your gloomy face

00:00:48.163 --> 00:00:49.022
What a joke

00:00:49.022 --> 00:00:51.148
I'm actually fair, rich and beautiful

00:00:51.148 --> 00:00:53.866
Then why would a fair, rich beauty care about KPI?

00:00:53.866 --> 00:00:55.259
I can see you're fair

00:00:55.259 --> 00:00:57.086
Bet you're "fairly" fortuneless

00:00:57.086 --> 00:00:59.615
The hell with your big mouth, jinx!

00:00:59.615 --> 00:01:01.129
Don't ever let me see you again!

00:01:02.838 --> 00:01:03.986
Why so pretentious?

00:01:03.986 --> 00:01:06.084
I used to be rich too

00:01:06.084 --> 00:01:08.110
You just need to have some spare cash

00:01:09.548 --> 00:01:10.653
Little Yang

00:01:10.653 --> 00:01:12.061
Come take a look for me

00:01:12.061 --> 00:01:13.703
How's my love life going?

00:01:13.703 --> 00:01:14.638
I don't want to

00:01:14.638 --> 00:01:16.126
If I tell the truth, you will deny it

00:01:16.126 --> 00:01:17.469
If I tell a lie, you will not buy it

00:01:17.769 --> 00:01:18.838
I'll listen

00:01:18.838 --> 00:01:19.693
I'll believe

00:01:19.693 --> 00:01:20.743
in whatever you say

00:01:20.743 --> 00:01:22.815
Please read my palm quick

00:01:22.815 --> 00:01:25.601
A dashing guy in a luxurious car

00:01:25.601 --> 00:01:28.614
Tell me if there's a chance?

00:01:28.614 --> 00:01:31.347
You're out of your mind due to aging, aren't you?

00:01:31.347 --> 00:01:32.712
The art style doesn't even suit you

00:01:32.712 --> 00:01:35.034
Brat, you itching

00:01:35.034 --> 00:01:36.035
to get beaten?

00:01:36.035 --> 00:01:37.066
You're full of garbage

00:01:37.066 --> 00:01:38.323
You're the one who asked me to do reading!

00:01:38.323 --> 00:01:39.446
Pay up!

00:01:39.446 --> 00:01:41.427
How dare you ask for money?

00:01:41.427 --> 00:01:42.866
Because you insist it!

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:46.472
That guy

00:01:46.472 --> 00:01:48.911
must be close by

00:01:52.076 --> 00:01:54.884
Lost in the direction of a vast road ahead

00:01:54.884 --> 00:01:59.943
Want to escape the cycle, be myself for once

00:01:59.943 --> 00:02:03.145
Crashing into a chaotic world

00:02:03.145 --> 00:02:08.869
Ever since I met you, my course has changed

00:02:10.414 --> 00:02:13.775
Define the world as infinity

00:02:13.775 --> 00:02:16.119
No need to be suspicious

00:02:16.119 --> 00:02:17.989
No need to doubt

00:02:17.989 --> 00:02:22.130
You're light, I'm darkness, in mutual opposition

00:02:22.130 --> 00:02:24.320
Like the opposite ends of magnets

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:26.334
In natural tacit agreement

00:02:26.334 --> 00:02:30.197
Quarrel gets reconciled in split seconds

00:02:30.197 --> 00:02:35.051
Can't see and can't hear in subtlety

00:02:35.051 --> 00:02:39.660
You know what I'm thinking

00:02:42.141 --> 00:02:44.794
Your trust is burning

00:02:46.127 --> 00:02:49.846
is my smiling response to the world

00:02:49.846 --> 00:02:51.748
Relying on each other

00:02:51.748 --> 00:02:54.063
Vast potential to rewrite life

00:02:54.063 --> 00:02:56.517
May be unexpected

00:02:56.517 --> 00:02:58.616
In every circumstance

00:03:02.534 --> 00:03:06.128
To face all battles together

00:03:06.128 --> 00:03:09.190
Let the chains that bound us together

00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:13.033
Converge into an unlimited, exciting

00:03:13.033 --> 00:03:18.153
Splendor

00:03:19.141 --> 00:03:22.616
Soul Contract

00:03:23.454 --> 00:03:27.377
First Contract

00:03:28.891 --> 00:03:31.861
Subbed by EP of Bayi Subs

00:03:35.713 --> 00:03:37.056
I'm Yang Jinghua

00:03:37.056 --> 00:03:38.697
My parents passed away when I was young

00:03:38.697 --> 00:03:39.889
and I've depleted my family fortunes

00:03:39.889 --> 00:03:43.306
My ancestors were said to be powerful exorcists

00:03:43.306 --> 00:03:44.542
They're very famous

00:03:44.542 --> 00:03:47.697
They even received the Emperors' gold tablet that's passed down from generations

00:03:47.697 --> 00:03:48.854
It brought glory to my family

00:03:49.702 --> 00:03:53.838
but when it comes to me, I can only do fortune telling

00:03:54.906 --> 00:03:56.333
It's not fair

00:03:56.333 --> 00:03:57.889
Master Yang

00:03:57.889 --> 00:03:58.893
You're back

00:03:58.893 --> 00:04:00.545
I'm off today!

00:04:00.545 --> 00:04:01.925
Stop asking me to do reading!

00:04:01.925 --> 00:04:03.332
I don't want any reading

00:04:03.332 --> 00:04:04.905
My laptop is broken

00:04:04.905 --> 00:04:06.546
Care to take a look?

00:04:07.304 --> 00:04:09.052
To cover the expenses

00:04:09.052 --> 00:04:11.413
I need to do part time job in PC servicing

00:04:11.413 --> 00:04:14.573
But then, I'm so poor I can't even afford spare parts

00:04:14.573 --> 00:04:17.911
I can only try my luck searching at a nearby dump site

00:04:19.924 --> 00:04:21.138
Not this type

00:04:21.138 --> 00:04:22.624
This won't work

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:25.121
What kind of plaything is this?

00:04:32.679 --> 00:04:34.788
It's so late, someone's still here?

00:04:38.476 --> 00:04:39.586
Damn it

00:04:39.586 --> 00:04:41.526
Why a Yangming Master

00:04:41.526 --> 00:04:43.335
shows up here?

00:04:43.335 --> 00:04:45.385
I suppose you're down on luck

00:04:45.385 --> 00:04:47.053
Time to die

00:04:48.478 --> 00:04:49.680
Who's there?

00:04:51.032 --> 00:04:52.188
Sorry

00:04:52.188 --> 00:04:53.347
I got so excited

00:04:53.347 --> 00:04:54.654
I can't stop screaming

00:04:54.654 --> 00:04:55.828
Are you shooting a film?

00:04:55.828 --> 00:04:57.671
The special effects are so realistic

00:04:57.671 --> 00:04:59.344
You can see her

00:04:59.344 --> 00:05:01.052
You must be talented

00:05:01.052 --> 00:05:01.998
Say your name

00:05:01.998 --> 00:05:04.002
I'm Yang Jinghua

00:05:04.002 --> 00:05:06.015
You are Song Joong-ki, aren't you?

00:05:06.015 --> 00:05:07.686
Being a Korean actor must be hard

00:05:07.686 --> 00:05:09.186
You can speak Chinese so well

00:05:10.317 --> 00:05:12.161
The talkative one must die!

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:16.024
What...

00:05:16.024 --> 00:05:17.848
What kind of witchcraft is that?

00:05:18.869 --> 00:05:20.546
It's an evil spiritual spell

00:05:20.546 --> 00:05:22.197
When an ordinary person gets hit

00:05:22.197 --> 00:05:23.792
His soul will be shattered to pieces

00:05:23.792 --> 00:05:26.073
You must quickly leave this place

00:05:26.073 --> 00:05:27.932
Yang Jinghua, right?

00:05:29.447 --> 00:05:31.384
I'll remember your name

00:05:31.384 --> 00:05:33.666
Who are you?

00:05:33.666 --> 00:05:35.151
I'm Duanmu Xi

00:05:35.151 --> 00:05:36.824
A Yangming Master

00:05:36.824 --> 00:05:41.294
An exorcist whose sole purpose is to cleanse this world of foul spirits

00:05:41.544 --> 00:05:42.653
Damn

00:05:42.653 --> 00:05:43.873
She's gone

00:05:43.873 --> 00:05:46.902
So you're a Taoist Priest

00:05:46.902 --> 00:05:48.216
Whatever

00:05:48.216 --> 00:05:50.291
If you have nothing important, please leave now

00:05:50.291 --> 00:05:51.651
Don't disturb me on my duty

00:05:51.651 --> 00:05:53.590
Don't be so pompous

00:05:53.590 --> 00:05:55.160
You're only a ritual practitioner

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:58.102
My ancestors were the great royal exorcists

00:05:58.102 --> 00:06:00.053
So I'm part of a distinguished family

00:06:00.053 --> 00:06:01.915
I'm the cool one too

00:06:02.133 --> 00:06:03.504
If it weren't for my parents

00:06:03.504 --> 00:06:05.512
that passed away too soon

00:06:06.974 --> 00:06:09.559
Not a single goodbye?

00:06:13.864 --> 00:06:14.786
Come to think of it

00:06:14.786 --> 00:06:16.082
I will be 30

00:06:16.082 --> 00:06:18.835
No wife, no car, no house

00:06:18.835 --> 00:06:21.038
What was I up to when I was younger?

00:06:21.720 --> 00:06:23.209
Try to be successful

00:06:23.209 --> 00:06:24.066
Try to earn more

00:06:24.066 --> 00:06:26.033
Try to be a better person, the 3 "tries" of this era

00:06:26.033 --> 00:06:27.521
If I ever want to change my identity

00:06:27.521 --> 00:06:29.940
I'd unlikely be where I am now

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:33.254
If I get the change to reincarnate

00:06:33.254 --> 00:06:34.477
I'd definitely want

00:06:34.477 --> 00:06:36.595
a different lifestyle

00:06:48.489 --> 00:06:50.629
So pretty it must be a boy

00:06:50.629 --> 00:06:52.390
My skin is so smooth and bright

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:53.461
My face looks attractive

00:06:53.461 --> 00:06:54.917
Have I reborn?

00:06:54.917 --> 00:06:57.259
You thought you're in a time travel drama?

00:06:57.259 --> 00:06:59.401
Listen up, Yang Jinghua

00:06:59.401 --> 00:07:01.122
You are dead

00:07:01.386 --> 00:07:02.590
You are now

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:03.980
a spirit

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:07.982
Aren't you the fake Korean actor who acts as a Taoist Priest?

00:07:09.292 --> 00:07:11.198
Stop fooling around

00:07:11.198 --> 00:07:13.682
I remembered I was walking on the street a moment ago

00:07:13.682 --> 00:07:15.729
The next moment you got run over by a truck

00:07:15.729 --> 00:07:17.671
You were squashed into 2D form

00:07:17.671 --> 00:07:19.833
Even though your body is no longer in one piece

00:07:19.833 --> 00:07:21.383
At least the rest of it is still in tact

00:07:21.383 --> 00:07:23.380
Do you want to check it?

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:26.239
Who's that bastard

00:07:26.239 --> 00:07:28.644
who drove blindly and killed me?

00:07:28.644 --> 00:07:33.414
I want them to pay by the debt of blood

00:07:33.615 --> 00:07:34.977
Early morning,

00:07:34.977 --> 00:07:37.332
another person was killed in a truck accident

00:07:37.332 --> 00:07:40.789
Incidents like this has occurred 47th time this year

00:07:40.789 --> 00:07:43.667
The boss is liable for earning quick cash by pushing for speed

00:07:43.667 --> 00:07:45.380
and the accident is covered by insurance

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:46.832
A tragedy caused by attitude of expecting a fluke...

00:07:46.832 --> 00:07:48.129
Bullcrap!

00:07:48.129 --> 00:07:50.950
It's because of your crookedness you've taken my life!

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:52.441
How can you be so inhumane?

00:07:52.441 --> 00:07:53.552
Give my life back!

00:07:53.552 --> 00:07:54.434
I curse you!

00:07:54.434 --> 00:07:55.691
I curse your whole family!

00:07:55.691 --> 00:07:57.427
I'll hang myself at your doorstep if you don't believe

00:07:57.427 --> 00:07:59.447
When a person died, he will go through several stages

00:07:59.447 --> 00:08:02.102
The 1st stage is feeling confused

00:08:02.102 --> 00:08:03.665
The 2nd stage

00:08:03.665 --> 00:08:06.130
is being in a state of self denial

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:07.661
Victim, Yang Jinghua, aged 23

00:08:07.661 --> 00:08:09.712
I'm on TV!

00:08:09.712 --> 00:08:12.177
This is the first time I've ever been on TV!

00:08:13.271 --> 00:08:15.130
The 3rd phase of emotional period

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:16.230
has started too soon

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:17.703
I can't believe I look good

00:08:17.703 --> 00:08:19.560
It's so awesome looking at myself appearing on TV

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:24.328
This is my first and last time on TV

00:08:24.328 --> 00:08:25.419
Oh yeah

00:08:25.419 --> 00:08:26.485
What about my compensation?

00:08:26.485 --> 00:08:28.125
Accident victims should get a few 10k, right?

00:08:28.125 --> 00:08:29.190
You got no relatives

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:30.610
Your compensated money

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:31.826
will be used as

00:08:31.826 --> 00:08:34.033
funds to rescue other accident victims

00:08:34.033 --> 00:08:35.532
What?!

00:08:35.532 --> 00:08:37.551
What the hell is this fund?!

00:08:37.551 --> 00:08:39.753
I'm the dead guy here, why use it to help others?

00:08:39.753 --> 00:08:41.332
This is my money!

00:08:41.332 --> 00:08:42.815
The hell with it

00:08:42.815 --> 00:08:45.253
Ever since I was young I've never seen so much money

00:08:45.253 --> 00:08:48.081
Not even a chance to touch it

00:08:48.285 --> 00:08:51.158
Then again, I've never done any good deeds either

00:08:51.158 --> 00:08:52.648
I donated so much after I died

00:08:52.648 --> 00:08:54.065
So, at least I have a purpose

00:08:54.065 --> 00:08:55.753
I was never a philanthropist

00:08:55.753 --> 00:08:57.441
And now I'm finally becoming one

00:09:00.391 --> 00:09:03.269
The most dreaded 4th stage,

00:09:03.269 --> 00:09:05.397
Incessant lunacy

00:09:09.114 --> 00:09:09.956
Well?

00:09:09.956 --> 00:09:10.974
Had enough?

00:09:10.974 --> 00:09:13.043
I still have plenty of stuffs I don't get it

00:09:13.043 --> 00:09:16.634
When person died, isn't he supposed to turn creepy or scary?

00:09:16.634 --> 00:09:20.644
But why do I look so radiant as if I had a make over?

00:09:20.644 --> 00:09:23.240
Sometimes when a person died,

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:25.055
his soul would reflect his happiest

00:09:25.055 --> 00:09:28.191
or his most sensitive moment in life

00:09:28.191 --> 00:09:29.207
Anyway

00:09:29.207 --> 00:09:30.707
It must be your innermost

00:09:30.707 --> 00:09:32.303
important moment of your life

00:09:33.328 --> 00:09:34.574
I remember now

00:09:34.574 --> 00:09:37.086
This was the look I had when I was in junior high

00:09:37.086 --> 00:09:39.085
The most wonderful age

00:09:39.085 --> 00:09:41.115
and the happiest day

00:09:42.635 --> 00:09:43.636
Jinghua

00:09:44.005 --> 00:09:45.381
Jinghua

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:49.730
Dad

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:50.808
Mom

00:09:55.355 --> 00:09:57.838
You're a spirit and you still daydream

00:09:57.838 --> 00:09:59.336
None of your business

00:09:59.336 --> 00:10:02.259
Anyhow, why do you keep following me?

00:10:02.259 --> 00:10:03.260
Because

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:05.680
I want you to be my Soul Image

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:07.257
Soul Image?

00:10:07.506 --> 00:10:09.006
When people died

00:10:09.006 --> 00:10:11.179
they'll have no concern with the living

00:10:11.179 --> 00:10:12.963
but some spirits are different

00:10:12.963 --> 00:10:16.617
They reflect their image in a mirror or water surface

00:10:16.617 --> 00:10:17.822
What I meant is

00:10:17.822 --> 00:10:19.553
even if you're out of body

00:10:19.553 --> 00:10:21.413
you can still communicate with the living

00:10:21.413 --> 00:10:24.350
These spirits naturally have powerful spiritual energy

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.150
Take for example, when you were alive

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:28.101
you could see spirits

00:10:28.101 --> 00:10:29.133
You're saying that

00:10:29.133 --> 00:10:31.936
I'm now in between the world of the living and dead?

00:10:31.936 --> 00:10:33.001
Right

00:10:33.001 --> 00:10:34.232
but even so

00:10:34.232 --> 00:10:36.731
You can only stay in this world up to 7 days

00:10:36.731 --> 00:10:39.534
If you don't want to vanish from here

00:10:39.534 --> 00:10:41.704
you can choose to be my Soul Image

00:10:41.704 --> 00:10:43.357
Sign a contract with me

00:10:43.357 --> 00:10:44.748
Help me out with my duty

00:10:47.331 --> 00:10:47.998
No

00:10:48.414 --> 00:10:51.100
In other words, you want me to work for you

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:53.135
I was treated like kid when I was alive

00:10:53.135 --> 00:10:55.037
but now I still have to obey you?

00:10:55.037 --> 00:10:56.913
Like I'd care!

00:10:56.913 --> 00:10:58.148
If that's how it is

00:10:58.148 --> 00:11:00.086
Then I won't give a damn!

00:11:01.467 --> 00:11:02.462
Help!

00:11:02.462 --> 00:11:04.320
I'm gonna to fall to my death from this height!

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:06.350
Shut up, you're dead already

00:11:10.476 --> 00:11:11.896
I can fly

00:11:11.896 --> 00:11:14.474
Is this what having a twist of luck feels?

00:11:15.642 --> 00:11:19.815
♪ Look at my left hand, right hand, one slow motion ♫

00:11:19.815 --> 00:11:22.842
♫ Right hand, left hand, replay in slow motion ♩

00:11:28.583 --> 00:11:31.749
Although it was a brief encounter with Yang Jinghua

00:11:31.749 --> 00:11:35.546
Duanmu Xi felt that his worldview had entirely been renewed

00:11:35.546 --> 00:11:37.546
He began to wonder if

00:11:37.546 --> 00:11:39.937
the deal he made with the guy

00:11:39.937 --> 00:11:42.297
might be more than he could take

00:11:46.408 --> 00:11:49.786
Looking at the stars

00:11:49.786 --> 00:11:56.582
Traveling through the sky with the cold moon

00:11:56.796 --> 00:12:00.328
Speak softly of

00:12:00.551 --> 00:12:06.172
the unspeakable yearnings

00:12:07.362 --> 00:12:11.078
Let the memories

00:12:11.078 --> 00:12:17.522
gets frozen as poems in the long night

00:12:18.176 --> 00:12:21.710
Let everything

00:12:21.967 --> 00:12:23.217
sunk faintly into silence

00:12:39.408 --> 00:12:42.361
while still carry

00:12:43.328 --> 00:12:48.405
the longing for the light

00:13:00.524 --> 00:13:03.744
is hope

00:13:04.835 --> 00:13:07.695
is metamorphosis
